      "what": "The study develops KMD-CTM, a hybrid physical framework that integrates Koopman mode decomposition with the cell transmission model to predict traffic density and flow. The model incorporates speed-dependent headway distributions to capture congested discharge dynamics, hysteresis, and capacity drops while maintaining physical consistency between upstream and downstream traffic.",
